  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The facial expression blendtree that comes with the avatar 3 SDK isn't implemented correctly. The two big problems:\n1) There's no motion located at 0,0 so if you actually add the mood_ blendshapes to your avatar, it gets stuck with a weird face because it's blending all 4 moods together. All it needs is an animation at 0,0 that sets all the mood_ blendshapes to 0.\n2)  The default expressions menu isn't built to even use this blendtree. The obvious intention is to use it in a puppet menu, but the default menu only has the emotes on it. It should probably be split into two: One as a submenu for the emotes, and the other as a puppet menu for the facial blend expressions.",
